# Reopening after a lost port (Phase 3): the notes that were sounding
# when it was lost get their note-offs at once, then All Notes Off
# (CC 123) on all 16 channels, so nothing is left hanging on the synth.
# Tracks 1 and 2 both sound 60 on channel 1 (one note-off, by the
# count); track 3 has 66 sounding. The port is lost at beat 4 by the
# note-off of 60 itself (track 2's, the one that reaches 0), which the
# synth never got, so it is sent on reopen too.
open virtual
track 1 60:4
track 2:1 60:4
track 3 64:1 65:1 66:2
play continue
runto 3
log
failwrites on
runto 5
state
log
failwrites off
open virtual
log
play continue
runto 5
log
# lost again at beat 6, by track 3's note-off of 65 (60 on channel 1
# is sounding): the same again
runto 5.5
log
failwrites on
runto 7
failwrites off
open virtual
log
close
